05:46.650 --> 05:48.820
I don't get what you said at all.

05:48.820 --> 05:51.530
Is your sister a student at our school?

05:51.530 --> 05:57.330
Yes... She's a second year in Shiradama Middle, but...

05:57.830 --> 06:00.580
only if she were still alive.

06:02.710 --> 06:06.550
