06:06.550 --> 06:07.470
Yes.

06:08.260 --> 06:10.720
My sister loved soft tennis.

06:10.720 --> 06:14.010
On that fateful day, she was rushing to a tournament.

06:15.600 --> 06:21.060
I-I always thought balls were our friends

06:21.060 --> 06:23.520
