09:17.570 --> 09:19.530
This is it! This feeling!

09:19.530 --> 09:23.620
This kind of wild excitement feels the best!

09:24.620 --> 09:28.210
I... I love... I love..

09:29.000 --> 09:32.460
I love soft tennis!

09:39.760 --> 09:42.350
Th-That's really...

09:42.350 --> 09:44.640
That's really... nice.

09:45.350 --> 09:49.730
H-Hey, Yayoi, did you bump
into something strange?

09:51.690 --> 09:53.070
Yayoi?

09:53.070 --> 09:55.360
Don't lump me together with her.

09:55.360 --> 09:57.360
I'm Uzuki!

09:57.650 --> 10:01.580
The self-proclaimed genius soft tennis player, Hiragishi Uzuki.

10:03.200 --> 10:07.620
The sister of a clumsy and stupid turtle!

10:05.790 --> 10:07.620
<b>Yayoi's sister,</b>

10:05.790 --> 10:07.620
<b>Hiragishi Uzuki (Died as 12 years old)</b>

10:07.830 --> 10:09.920
T-The sister...

10:09.920 --> 10:11.170
What's going on?

10:15.420 --> 10:17.550
Sis came out again!

10:19.130 --> 10:21.640
Sorry for frightening you.

10:21.640 --> 10:23.970
I'll explain everything.

10:23.970 --> 10:27.980
My sister Uzuki really died two years ago.

10:28.480 --> 10:33.270
But her spirit lingers behind, in my body.

10:33.900 --> 10:38.240
She was about to play against her
rival in an important tournament,

10:38.240 --> 10:40.240
just before the accident happened.

10:40.240 --> 10:42.450
My sister's regret is too strong.

10:42.450 --> 10:46.410
She won't be able to rest until she
has a final match with that person.

10:46.410 --> 10:48.790
I see. So that's it.

10:48.790 --> 10:53.420
But Sis has a limited time outside.

10:53.420 --> 10:56.670
I have to do something, somehow.

10:56.670 --> 10:58.800
Th-That's really tough...

10:57.800 --> 11:02.180
<b>{11:08}You seem to 
be bad at sports...</b>

10:59.380 --> 11:03.550
Also, this is my sister's message to all of you:

11:03.800 --> 11:04.930
Message?

11:06.350 --> 11:10.100
Bring me to the finals, even if it kills you.

11:10.100 --> 11:11.940
If you dare refuse,

11:11.940 --> 11:15.400
I'll make you all suffer in the afterlife.

11:15.690 --> 11:17.360
That's what she said.

11:20.070 --> 11:22.410
I-Is it all right, Eli-chan?

11:22.700 --> 11:25.030
Teaming up with Yayoi-chan?

11:28.660 --> 11:33.330
It is no problem. We have to help each other in times of trouble.

11:33.330 --> 11:37.800
And helping each other is
what being a pair is all about.

11:41.760 --> 11:45.760
Yayoi, we are a pair now.

11:45.760 --> 11:49.220
Let's fight together from now on, three-as-one.{who's the third musketeer?}{3 - eliz, yayoi and her elder sister, uzuki}

11:49.220 --> 11:50.600
Yes!

11:53.980 --> 11:56.650
<i>How nice of her...</i>

12:02.910 --> 12:07.660
All right. Next, I'll hand out the test papers from last week's quiz.

12:07.660 --> 12:12.710
Aida sixty points, Inoue forty-five points, Itou eighty points.

12:12.710 --> 12:15.250
Why does she have to read out the scores?

12:15.250 --> 12:16.630
It's probably her hobby.

12:17.500 --> 12:19.380
'Zabeth, ninety-three points.

12:21.210 --> 12:22.510
Here. Applaud.

12:22.970 --> 12:26.470
Everyone should learn from 'Zabeth.

12:28.640 --> 12:29.970
<i>'Zabeth.</i>

12:30.180 --> 12:32.940
Continuing... Harukaze.

12:32.940 --> 12:33.690
Here!

12:33.690 --> 12:35.980
Oh, nice answer.

12:36.730 --> 12:38.150
Not at all.

12:38.150 --> 12:41.230
As a reward, I'll add another five points.

12:41.230 --> 12:42.190
Yes!

12:46.660 --> 12:48.910
D-Don't mind it.

12:50.700 --> 12:53.160
All right! I'm number one!

12:53.410 --> 12:55.870
So fast! You're amazing, Kotone-chan!

12:55.870 --> 12:58.040
You even outran the boys!

12:59.250 --> 13:01.290
When it comes to physical tests, I'm unbeatable!

13:01.960 --> 13:06.090
Talking about tests... Study sessions
for the midterms begin on Monday.

13:06.090 --> 13:10.560
Learning for tests? Don't be silly, I don't care.

13:10.560 --> 13:12.890
I usually don't study anyway.

13:12.890 --> 13:16.440
And cramming before tests?
How can I do something that pathetic?

13:16.770 --> 13:20.570
Besides, I only come to school
for club activities.

13:20.570 --> 13:22.190
Learning is secondary!

13:22.570 --> 13:26.700
Tests are only based on luck.
Nothing to be scared of!

13:31.160 --> 13:33.370
Here's the order from above:

13:33.870 --> 13:38.670
If you fail even one test in the midterms,
you can't take part in the tournament.

13:37.370 --> 13:40.090
<b>Oh my...</b>

13:37.370 --> 13:40.090
<b>That's 
how it is.</b>

13:37.370 --> 13:40.090
<b>Woah</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:40.380
Oh my...

13:38.710 --> 13:40.380
<b>{TS}{13:50}</b>

13:40.090 --> 13:40.880
<b>Oh my...</b>

13:40.090 --> 13:40.880
<b>That's 
how it is.</b>

13:40.090 --> 13:40.880
<b>Woah</b>

13:41.550 --> 13:43.170
I-Impossible!

13:43.170 --> 13:47.880
Is this how they treat people who gave their all to soft tennis?

13:47.880 --> 13:49.800
Too cruel! This is too cruel!

13:49.800 --> 13:54.390
<b>God is dead.</b>

13:50.010 --> 13:53.220
I didn't learn anything at all in class!

13:53.220 --> 13:54.730
Why?!

13:54.390 --> 13:56.310
<b>God is dead.</b>

13:54.730 --> 13:56.310
That's the obvious reason.

13:55.350 --> 13:56.310
<b>You got 
what you 
deserved.</b>

13:57.480 --> 14:03.190
This is the greatest crisis the Shiradama
Middle Soft Tennis Club has ever faced.

14:03.690 --> 14:09.780
Therefore, I proclaim we shall hold an emergency
study session somewhere tomorrow.

14:09.780 --> 14:14.370
Everyone, this is the time to display our unity!

14:14.370 --> 14:15.660
Yes, we can!

14:16.080 --> 14:17.450
Yes, we can!

14:17.710 --> 14:19.120
Yes, we can!

14:19.290 --> 14:21.920
That translates to: "Yes, we can!"

14:22.210 --> 14:24.550
Yes, we can!

14:24.550 --> 14:26.550
You're doing it wrong, you know?

14:27.550 --> 14:32.600
That's why I said you can't use my room!

14:32.600 --> 14:36.060
Too bad, no one else wants to give us a room.

14:36.310 --> 14:40.400
Think of this as part of your job.

14:40.400 --> 14:42.900
Mishi, you can just relax properly while—

14:44.690 --> 14:48.280
<i>As if I could relax at all.</i>

14:50.240 --> 14:51.870
Kotone-chan,

14:52.320 --> 14:54.370
please wash these too.

14:54.370 --> 14:55.200
All right.

14:59.870 --> 15:04.540
<i>These... These... are Mishi's bo-box...</i>

15:06.340 --> 15:09.260
Mishi... wore—

15:08.800 --> 15:10.550
<b>{TS}{15:19} Kurusu{lazy TS}</b>

15:11.680 --> 15:15.060
Say, Kurusu-chan, you normally don't wear those, do you?

15:15.060 --> 15:16.680
Mm, that's right.

15:15.060 --> 15:17.060
<b>{15:26}Just bought 
them for 100¥</b>

15:19.060 --> 15:20.730
<i>So he wears briefs.</i>

15:21.940 --> 15:25.320
How's it going, Hiragishi? You feeling
comfortable in the soft tennis club yet?

15:25.320 --> 15:28.940
Yes, everyone treats me really nice.

15:28.940 --> 15:32.660
I see. I heard you just transferred schools.

15:32.660 --> 15:35.450
{Its troublsome isn't it? To not have friends from the get go}{original - You don't have any close friends, is that troubling?}Isn't it tough without any close friends around?

15:35.450 --> 15:36.330
No.

15:36.660 --> 15:38.250
Please don't think of me like that.

15:38.250 --> 15:40.540
I'm actually really good at making friends.

15:41.370 --> 15:42.710
That's great.

15:43.040 --> 15:50.300
Even though, most of my friends
don't have any {real}corporeal bodies.

15:51.340 --> 15:54.590
A few of them are in this room too.

15:54.590 --> 15:56.140
Huh? Coach?

15:57.180 --> 15:58.470
Lapun!

15:59.520 --> 16:00.770
What are all these?

16:00.770 --> 16:01.980
Amazing!

16:02.560 --> 16:04.650
They're just trophies I won in the past.

16:04.980 --> 16:07.900
I didn't have anywhere to put them,
so I just stuffed them all in there.

16:08.280 --> 16:12.150
Our goals are treated like this...

16:12.150 --> 16:15.240
Although, they really are useless.

16:15.240 --> 16:16.450
Not completely true.

16:16.450 --> 16:18.790
Some of them have their uses.

16:19.080 --> 16:20.540
Look.

16:20.830 --> 16:23.120
It's useful to grow chili at home.

16:23.580 --> 16:26.540
<i>What are our goals...</i>

16:29.800 --> 16:34.220
<i>This is the photo I gave Mishi!</i>

16:35.470 --> 16:38.680
<i>Looks well taken care of.</i>

16:40.060 --> 16:42.390
Eli, come help me with this.

16:42.890 --> 16:44.980
Yes! I am coming.

16:52.190 --> 16:54.200
That's more like it.

16:54.200 --> 16:56.910
My heart has finally calmed down.

16:57.320 --> 17:00.330
Coach, I found this in the closet.

17:00.330 --> 17:02.910
Is this the racket you used?

17:03.210 --> 17:05.790
Oh, so that's where I put it.

17:05.790 --> 17:09.250
But the strings are really loose.{like asuna}

17:09.250 --> 17:11.840
Can one play this way?

17:12.960 --> 17:14.380
Of course.

17:16.340 --> 17:22.180
You might actually say I became the champion because of it.

17:24.480 --> 17:29.230
Power or speed... I don't have {weapons}strengths like that.

17:29.610 --> 17:30.860
If I had a skill...

17:31.270 --> 17:33.990
it'd be my nimble hands.

17:34.280 --> 17:38.320
I wanted to fight strong people from
all over the country with just that,

17:38.320 --> 17:42.990
so I needed more ball variations to confuse my opponents.

17:43.580 --> 17:45.870
Even though it's a really hard to control racket,

17:45.870 --> 17:48.000
when I became used to it,

17:48.710 --> 17:52.550
I had an infinite number of ball variations at my fingertips.

17:52.550 --> 17:56.800
Well, there's various ways to play tennis.

17:57.300 --> 18:01.100
It feels like we heard a pretty nice story.

18:02.810 --> 18:08.690
<b>{TS}{18:14}That's the way to reach the top!</b>

18:03.010 --> 18:06.430
I'll quickly loosen my strings once I get home!

18:06.180 --> 18:08.690
<b>I was talking 
about expressing 
your personality.</b>

18:06.430 --> 18:08.690
Listen to other people first.

18:09.730 --> 18:14.860
<i>If I have a skill, then it has to be my Ero-charisma!</i>

18:14.070 --> 18:14.860
<b>{TS}{18:23}{ Ero-aura / }Wrong</b>

18:14.860 --> 18:20.280
<i>My goal has to be using my pheromones on the other players.</i>

18:20.660 --> 18:24.910
<i>My erotic appeal and beauty... Using all kinds
of passionate{vivacious/effervescent} moves to seduce the audience.</i>

18:24.910 --> 18:28.290
<i>The sounds from the audience animating me!</i>

18:28.710 --> 18:30.040
<i>Finally, ascending to...</i>

18:30.540 --> 18:32.000
<i>nude tennis!</i>

18:32.630 --> 18:38.510
<i>How many hurdles do I have to jump to
reach my goal... That's the question.</i>

18:38.510 --> 18:42.720
<i>Asuna-chan's been touched by the coach's words.</i>

18:42.600 --> 18:43.350
<b>{TS}{18:52}Wrong.</b>

18:44.010 --> 18:46.310
So, today's main event...

18:47.140 --> 18:48.890
Let us begin the study session!

18:48.890 --> 18:49.850
Begin!

18:50.150 --> 18:53.190
You two have to review almost every subject.

18:52.310 --> 18:53.190
<b>{TS}{19:02} Ah~~
how embarassing.</b>

18:53.400 --> 18:55.480
I am going to review Japanese.

18:55.480 --> 18:58.700
I-I'm not good with social studies.

18:58.700 --> 19:01.320
Kurusu, what are you doi—

19:03.240 --> 19:04.240
<b>{TS}{19:15}The Six Codes</b>

19:04.240 --> 19:07.620
<b>{TS}{19:15}The Six Codes</b>

19:04.950 --> 19:07.620
Eating chips and studying law!{TL Note: Six Codes = Six major codes of law}

19:06.080 --> 19:07.620
<b>{TS}{19:15}That's not 
studying for 
the exam at all!</b>

19:11.460 --> 19:14.920
<i>The next tournament will be my last.</i>

19:14.920 --> 19:19.590
<i>Making sure everyone gets there is my duty as Club President.</i>

19:20.340 --> 19:23.180
Ask me if you don't know about something,

19:23.180 --> 19:26.430
Let's join the tournament together!

19:26.720 --> 19:28.680
Quick, this question!

19:28.680 --> 19:30.350
It's depending on you now, Chitose-san!

19:30.730 --> 19:33.020
Mm, leave it to me!

19:33.360 --> 19:35.480
{TS}{19:44\fs40} 2 Hours later

19:35.730 --> 19:38.740
Well, there's always next year.

19:43.370 --> 19:47.040
What? You're going to study all night in my house?!

19:47.040 --> 19:49.000
Don't be silly.

19:49.950 --> 19:52.580
Children have to sleep at home.

19:52.790 --> 19:56.670
It's obvious. I have my own private life...

19:59.670 --> 20:01.670
<b>Tonight, it's 
only the 
two of us...
Masako.</b>

20:02.380 --> 20:06.550
Although, I shouldn't stop students from studying.

20:07.100 --> 20:09.270
Everybody should work hard till tomorrow!

20:09.270 --> 20:10.230
Yes!

20:10.350 --> 20:11.890
All right, let's go!

20:14.190 --> 20:15.110
I can't do it any more!

20:15.110 --> 20:18.320
The more I study, the less I know!

20:18.320 --> 20:21.900
Kotone-chan, hang in there, keep fighting.{hold on for now, work hard.}

20:21.900 --> 20:24.410
I can't fight anymore.

20:24.410 --> 20:29.120
It's true that not making progress after learning
this much can discourage you quite a bit.

20:29.540 --> 20:33.620
If you can't even get past this, then you
won't stand a chance in the tournament.

20:33.620 --> 20:34.620
<i>So</i> sad.

20:34.620 --> 20:35.880
Shut up, you drunkard!

20:36.460 --> 20:39.710
What's up? It's so crowded today.

20:40.260 --> 20:42.340
Shiki-sempai?

20:42.340 --> 20:44.260
What? It's you guys.

20:42.340 --> 20:46.220
<b>{20:53} Former Soft Tennis Club President,</b>

20:42.340 --> 20:46.220
<b>Nishioka Shiki (High School, 1st Year)</b>

20:44.260 --> 20:46.220
Why're so many people here?

20:46.430 --> 20:48.600
What about you? Why are you—

20:48.600 --> 20:51.430
I'm here to cook for that drunkard.

20:52.680 --> 20:58.060
Th-Their relationship is at the point where she
comes to his house to cook, which means...

20:58.310 --> 20:59.860
Calm down, Kotone-chan!

21:01.150 --> 21:04.240
That's right. We only told Chitose.

21:05.410 --> 21:07.450
Cousins?!

21:07.450 --> 21:09.240
That's how it is.

21:09.240 --> 21:12.790
If I leave him as drunk as he is, he'll
eat just about anything, you see?

21:12.790 --> 21:14.960
So I have to show up like today from time to time.

21:15.290 --> 21:16.040
See?

21:16.040 --> 21:17.710
That's great, Kotone-chan!

21:17.710 --> 21:20.750
What're you talking about? I wasn't...

21:21.630 --> 21:22.800
<b>{TS}{21:32} You didn't 
change at all.</b>

21:24.260 --> 21:25.590
Midterms, huh?

21:26.510 --> 21:30.430
Those two are the only ones in danger.

21:30.430 --> 21:34.350
<b>{TS}{21:40} You've got it right.</b>

21:32.430 --> 21:34.310
Let me see the textbooks.

21:34.930 --> 21:36.810
You're going to teach us?

21:37.100 --> 21:39.150
No way.

21:39.900 --> 21:41.270
Women have to rely on

21:41.270 --> 21:43.190
their sixth sense!

21:47.910 --> 21:51.450
Remember all the places I marked down just now.

21:51.830 --> 21:56.330
I wouldn't bother with the rest.

21:57.250 --> 22:01.210
<i>Our fate depends on your sixth sense.</i>

21:57.460 --> 22:02.340
<b>{TS}{22:07}Nice work...</b>

22:16.350 --> 22:17.350
So...

22:21.230 --> 22:25.110
Still, I'm really surprised.

22:26.530 --> 22:29.240
Yeah.

22:36.660 --> 22:40.250
<i>We didn't think she'd be right
with every one of them.</i>

22:53.390 --> 22:58.690
<b><i>I extended my arms up high</i></b>

22:53.390 --> 22:58.690
takaku takaku ude wo nobashita

22:53.390 --> 22:58.690
高く高く腕を伸ばした

22:58.770 --> 23:04.150
<b><i>Knowing that they wouldn't reach</i></b>

22:58.770 --> 23:04.150
todokanai koto kurai wakatteru kedo

22:58.770 --> 23:04.150
届かないことくらいわかってるけど

23:04.270 --> 23:09.490
<b><i>I might be a crybaby</i></b>

23:04.270 --> 23:09.490
nakimushi dakedo sonna jibun mo

23:04.270 --> 23:09.490
泣き虫だけどそんな自分も

23:09.650 --> 23:15.030
<b><i>But I just can't hate myself, so I'm still here</i></b>

23:09.650 --> 23:15.030
kirai ni wa narenakute mada koko ni iru

23:09.650 --> 23:15.030
キライにはなれなくてまだココに居る

23:15.870 --> 23:21.040
<b><i>I dream about a tomorrow that I see far away</i></b>

23:15.870 --> 23:21.040
aa kogareta ashita wa mada tooku de

23:15.870 --> 23:21.040
ああ　焦がれた明日はまだ遠くで

23:21.250 --> 23:25.800
<b><i>It's smiling, beckoning</i></b>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.800
waratte iru temaneki shinagara

23:21.250 --> 23:25.800
笑っている　手招きしながら

23:26.090 --> 23:31.970
<b><i>Count 1 2 3 and raise up your heels</i></b>

23:26.090 --> 23:31.970
ichi ni san kazoe kakato wo agete miru

23:26.090 --> 23:31.970
123　数えかかとを上げてみる

23:32.260 --> 23:36.850
<b><i>Do it a little more, then just a little more</i></b>

23:32.260 --> 23:36.850
mou sukoshi sou ato sukoshi kurikaeshite wa

23:32.260 --> 23:36.850
もう少し　そうあと少し　繰り返しては

23:37.060 --> 23:42.150
<b><i>If I take a breath as deep as I can</i></b>

23:37.060 --> 23:42.150
dekiru dake ookiku iki wo shite

23:37.060 --> 23:42.150
出来るだけ大きく息をして

23:42.310 --> 23:47.190
<b><i>And imagine myself flying in the skies</i></b>

23:42.310 --> 23:47.190
sora wo tobu imeeji wo sureba

23:42.310 --> 23:47.190
空を飛ぶイメージをすれば

23:47.780 --> 23:52.490
<b><i>Then I can go anywhere!</i></b>

23:47.780 --> 23:52.490
doko e datte ikeru yo hora ne

23:47.780 --> 23:52.490
どこへだって行けるよほらね

23:53.700 --> 24:00.290
<b><i>I'm still dreaming of that one day when I might be able to fly</i></b>

23:53.700 --> 24:00.290
itsuka toberu kana nante yume minagara

23:53.700 --> 24:00.290
いつか飛べるかな　なんて夢見ながら

24:11.510 --> 24:12.880
Hello, I'm Yayoi.

24:12.880 --> 24:14.010
I'm Elizabeth.

24:14.010 --> 24:17.060
Next week we seem to have swimsuits and panty-shots.

24:17.060 --> 24:19.140
This is Japan's tranquility and elegance.

24:19.140 --> 24:22.770
You on the left have to say, "Be sure to watch it."

24:22.770 --> 24:25.270
Where? Where is that?

24:23.270 --> 24:25.270
<b>Game 11</b>

24:23.270 --> 24:25.270
<b>Travel</b>

24:23.270 --> 24:25.270
<b>Next Episode:</b>
